      "trimmed, collapsed or reflowed: the offsets are the contract.",
      "",
      "THE ROWS CARRY NO PAGE AND NO BOX \u2014 page 0, a zero rectangle, no typography",
      "report, no chapter seed, no figures \u2014 for the imported EPUB's reason. A",
      "recording has no pages to estimate, nothing to measure a type size from, and",
